                        h4.text-white-50.mx-auto.mt-2.mb-5 The Pi Hole project adds a new layer of security to one's home network to block unwanted ads and metrics across the network. The Pi Hole runs on a Raspberry Pi III.

            .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                .row.gx-0.mb-4.mb-lg-5.justify-content-center
